---
import LegalLayout from "../components/LegalLayout.astro";
import { site, contact } from "../data/content.js";
---
<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" updated="October 2026">
  <p>
    This page explains how {site.name} handles information collected through
    this website.
  </p>

  <h2>Information collected</h2>
  <p>
    When you submit the contact form, the details you enter are sent to me: your
    name, email address, project type, budget range, deadline and message. The
    site's host also keeps basic technical logs (such as IP address and browser
    type) for security.
  </p>

  <h2>How it is used</h2>
  <p>
    Contact submissions are used only to reply to your enquiry and discuss
    potential work. Your information is not sold or shared for marketing.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party services</h2>
  <p>
    The contact form is delivered by Web3Forms, fonts load from Google Fonts, and
    the site is hosted on Vercel. WhatsApp opens in its own app or site when you
    use the message button. Each of these handles the data it needs to work.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    To ask what is held about you, or to have it deleted, email
    <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
